i-light:#1F2328\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">return</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> (</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Calendar</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> value</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">={</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">date</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">}</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> onChange</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">={</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">setDate</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">}</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> className</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"rounded-lg border\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> /></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">)</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://react-aria.adobe.com/Calendar\">React Aria</a> documentation for more information.</p>\n<h2 id=\"date-picker\">Date Picker</h2>\n<p>You can use the <code>&#x3C;Calendar></code> component to build a date picker. See the <a href=\"/docs/components/aria/date-picker\">Date Picker</a> page for more information.</p>\n<h2 id=\"international-calendars\">International Calendars</h2>\n<p>To use international calendar systems such as Persian, Islamic, or Buddhist, use React Aria's <code>I18nProvider</code> to set the locale.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;calendar-hijri&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;title&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;Persian / Hijri / Jalali Calendar&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;description&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;A Persian calendar.&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;previewClassName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;h-[400px]&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"basic\">Basic</h2>\n<p>A basic calendar component. We used <code>className=\"rounded-lg border\"</code> to style the calendar.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;calendar-basic&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;previewClassName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;h-96&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"range-calendar\">Range Calendar</h2>\n<p>Use the <code>RangeCalendar</code> component to enable range selection.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;calendar-range&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;previewClassName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;h-[36rem] md:h-96&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"month-and-year-selector\">Month and Year Selector</h2>\n<p>Use <code>captionLayout=\"dropdown\"</code> to show month and year dropdowns.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;calendar-caption&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;previewClassName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;h-96&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"presets\">Presets</h2>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;calendar-presets&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;previewClassName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;h-[650px]&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"date-and-time-picker\">Date and Time Picker</h2>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;calendar-time&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;previewClassName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;h-[600px]&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"booked-dates\">Booked dates</h2>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;calendar-booked-dates&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;previewClassName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;h-96&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"custom-cell-size\">Custom Cell Size</h2>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;calendar-custom-days&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;title&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;Custom Cell Size&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;description&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;A calendar with custom cell size that&#x27;s responsive.&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;**:[.preview]:h-[560px]&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<p>You can customize the size of calendar cells using the <code>--cell-size</code> CSS variable. You can also make it responsive by using breakpoint-specific values:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"<Calendar\n  value={date}\n  onChange={setDate}\n  className=&#x22;rounded-lg border [--cell-size:--spacing(11)] md:[--cell-size:--spacing(12)]&#x22;\n/>\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Calendar</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">  value</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">={</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">date</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">  onChange</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">={</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">setDate</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">  className</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"rounded-lg border [--cell-size:--spacing(11)] md:[--cell-size:--spacing(12)]\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">/></span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Or use fixed values:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"<Calendar\n  value={date}\n  onChange={setDate}\n  className=&#x22;rounded-lg border [--cell-size:2.75rem] md